{
 "_doc": "REG-1 C9.24 allowed diffs: [page, testid, property|__presence__] triples. Empty in 013 WI-9; grows only in WI-12/WI-13, one itemised entry per intended change. 013 WI-12 (settings slice): settings.html moved from static/settings.css + 2 inline styles to the token-only Vite entry frontend/src/settings/index.css (prototype designs/reader-pro-next/settings.jsx). Every settings entry below is that restyle: body/set-screen take --r3-bg/--r3-text/--r3-font-sans/--r3-font-size-base/--r3-leading-normal and set-screen becomes a flex column with no own padding; set-topbar becomes the sticky --r3-surface bar with --r3-space padding; the back link becomes an inline-flex --r3-accent pill (--r3-radius-sm, 500 weight, --r3-font-size-sm); the data/export buttons become .set-btn (inline-flex, --r3-control-px padding, --r3-radius-sm, 500 weight, tight leading), the two data buttons in the .set-btn-danger colours (--r3-error on --r3-error-subtle). Only page=settings changed; library/reader snapshots are untouched and the snapshot itself was not regenerated. 013 WI-13 (library slice): library.html moved from static/dedao-theme.css + ~1400 lines of inline <style> and style= attributes to the token-only Vite entry frontend/src/library/index.css (prototype designs/reader-pro-next/app.jsx), so every one of the 57 library REG-1 testids changes; each library entry below is that restyle and nothing else: the shell/topbar/sidebar/insights/panels take --r3-bg/--r3-surface/--r3-text/--r3-font-sans/--r3-font-size-base/--r3-leading-normal with --r3-space padding; the topbar nav links become --r3-radius-sm pills (the current one on --r3-accent-subtle); toolbar, bulk-bar, chat and dialog buttons become .lib-btn / .lib-icon-btn / .lib-mini-btn (inline-flex, --r3-control-px padding, --r3-radius-sm, 500 weight, tight leading; primary on --r3-accent); inputs and selects become .lib-input (--r3-surface, --r3-radius-sm, --r3-font-size-sm); the book grid/table, status pills, stats, chat thread, search panel, dialogs and the index-errors list take the matching token surface/radius/type. reader.html is untouched in this slice, and the snapshot itself was not regenerated. 337 library entries added, all measured by C9.24, none inferred.",
